      "ELKINS, Gary R.; BARABASZ, Arreed F.; COUNCIL, James R.; SPIEGEL, David. Advancing research and practice: the revised APA Division 30 definition of hypnosis. International Journal of Clinical and Experimental Hypnosis, v. 63, n. 1, p. 1-9, 2015. DOI: 10.1080/00207144.2014.961870. Disponível em: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25365125/. Acesso em: 7 out. 2026.",
      "INSTITUTO BRASILEIRO DE COACHING. Coaching Ericksoniano - CEK. [S. l.]: IBC, [s. d.]. Disponível em: https://www.ibccoaching.com.br/nossos-cursos/coaching-ericksoniano/. Acesso em: 7 out. 2026.",
