      "VIA INSTITUTE ON CHARACTER. VIA-IS Assessment: psychometrics. Cincinnati: VIA Institute on Character, [s. d.]. Disponível em: https://www.viacharacter.org/researchers/assessments/via-is. Acesso em: 7 out. 2026."
